.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Unity — Editor-generated output only. ANCHORED to unity\ (2026-07-28): these
# rules used to be unanchored at repo root, so `*.csproj` swallowed the
# hand-written client projects and needed a rescue commit (ae54af8) to
# un-ignore them. Anchoring means source outside unity\ is simply source.
unity/[Ll]ibrary/
unity/[Tt]emp/
unity/[Ll]ogs/
unity/[Bb]uild/
unity/[Bb]uilds/
unity/[Oo]bj/
unity/UserSettings/
unity/*.csproj
unity/*.sln
unity/*.slnx
unity/.vs/
unity/.vscode/
# Captures are scratch; the stage-2 receipt moved to the untracked-local record
# at the 2026-09-11 lean-down (it was negated-in as evidence 2026-07-28..09-11).
unity/Captures/*
# Third-party editor bridge, embedded locally by its setup wizard; the
# Packages/manifest.json git URL re-resolves it on a fresh clone.
unity/Packages/com.coplaydev.unity-mcp/

# .NET build output (client\ has its own .gitignore for bin/ and obj/)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
!client/**/*.csproj
!client/**/*.sln

# Eval run artifacts (eval-harness.md stage 2, fork 7: runs stay local;
# milestone numbers get quoted into dated doc entries instead)
data/eval/runs/

# THE AI-PAIR APPARATUS — untracked-local by ruling (2026-09-13). The operating
# rules (CLAUDE.md) and the .claude\ tooling (auditor agents, verification hooks,
# session commands, settings) are internal build process, not part of the
# published portfolio. They stay on disk and keep working locally; they only
# leave the public tip. tests\CLAUDE.md stays TRACKED: it is the structural-test
# discipline the suite itself cites, and reads as clean public documentation.
/CLAUDE.md
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md

# The research folder is a ~117 MB store of 45 source PDFs — too big to upload,
# and not ours to redistribute. The WRITING that came out of it (FINDINGS.md,
# CHANGES-FROM-RESEARCH.md, the per-paper notes) was tracked in docs\research\
# 2026-07-28..2026-09-11, then joined the untracked-local record (below).
Research Papers/

# THE INTERNAL PROJECT RECORD — untracked-local since the 2026-09-11 lean-down
